==Battleground==
*1 [[King Wahwah]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Daboo of the Dead]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While Loris can hinder anything affected by Curse, it spawns fairly late. The Relic Doges and Gokurakko should be priority targets, with the former spawning indefinitely and the latter boasting extreme stats, enough for Daboo and Wahwah to constantly advance. Any dedicated strategies for the original will have to be slightly altered to account for them.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
A lot of units from the original Floor 46 similarly work here to a similar degree.
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]]: While not as strong as the original Floor 46 due to Shy Boy getting replaced, Courier's pure stats still let him do an excellent job, particularly with removing Sir Seal.
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]]: Slime works to a similar degree, still being the same old disposable unit you know and love. His True Form in particular allows him to hit both Sir Seal and Loris better.
*[[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]]: Great disposable damager that can potentially get some crazy value from Gokurakko's Knockback ability.
*[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]: Still works here, although isn't as good onto Gokurakko versus Shy Boy. But is that really worth complaining for, when Can Can rips and tears through everything else?
*[[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder]]: A quick unit able to wall the enemies here for a few seconds. Take caution when using Boulder against Gokurakko, as it can trigger Gokurakko's Omnistrike.
*[[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell]]: Powerful tanker similar to Boulder that can grant you relief for a few seconds.
*[[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Doron]]: With the addition of Loris, Doron becomes even better to potentially Freeze Loris. Similar to Boulder, be careful if Gokurakko is on the field, as an accidental Surge onto Gokurakko can result in chaos.
*[[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom]]/[[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Cafeteria]]: Excellent units that make dealing with Gokurakko less of a hassle.
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]]: Additional nuke damage that helps in general. From getting a few hundred thousand more damage on Gokurakko, to cleaning up Wahwah after Daboo's dead, what's there not to love?

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*Tankers with Knockback Immunity do excellently at keeping both Advent bosses under management. [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Kai μ]], [[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine]] and [[Hades the Punisher (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Hades]] do an excellent job. Talented [[Gravi (Uber Rare Cat)|Gravolodon]] is especially useful, as it not only has a defense up combo with green shell, but his waves keep WahWah away while your units chip Daboo. Just be careful when you spawn him as to not receive too much damage from enemies so he can get enough damage off before dying.
*[[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Balrog]]: His ridiculous damage allows him to quickly deal insane amounts of damage to anything here: whether it be triggering quicker damage knockbacks on Daboo, or just beating the stuffing out of Gokurakko, Balrog can do it all. Just don't spam him, or else he'll be a drain on your wallet.
*Rushers, preferably Anti-Angel, are welcome here. [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Yukimura]], [[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Kalisa]] and [[Lasvoss (Uber Rare Cat)|Lasvoss]] all do excellently here. Lasvoss in particular still wrecks havoc even if you don't have his Speed Up talent unlocked.
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]]: A spammable Anti-Angel who does great at killing Gokurakko here.
*[[Mighty Kat-A-Pult (Uber Rare Cat)|CAT-10 Gigapult]]: Being an anti-Zombie/Relic damage dealer and tank he can deal devastating damage to both Daboo of the Dead and Loris while surviving many of their attacks. Because of his overall high piercing range and Wave Attack Talent if it lands, he is able to snipe King Wahwah.

